---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { CATEGORIES, SITE } from '../lib/site';
const topics = Object.entries(CATEGORIES);
const chips = ['Prometheus', 'Grafana', 'ELK Stack', 'Apache Kafka', 'ClickHouse', 'Kubernetes', 'Big Data', 'DevOps', 'Monitoring', 'Databases'];
---
<Base title="About" description="About Bach Nguyen, a developer who loves technology, books and coffee, writing from Hanoi, Vietnam.">
  <div class="container about">
    <header class="about-head">
      <div class="about-photo"><img src={SITE.avatar} alt={`${SITE.name} - profile photo`} width="768" height="768" /></div>
      <div>
        <h1>~/about</h1>
        <p class="about-name">{SITE.name} <span>({SITE.altName})</span></p>
        <p class="about-sub">A developer who loves technology, books and coffee.</p>
        <p class="about-loc">📍 {SITE.location}</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <p class="about-lead">
      Hi, I'm <strong>Bach Nguyen</strong>, though some friends call me <em>Mr. Robot</em>.
      I'm the author of this blog, and I'm glad you're curious about the journey behind these pages.
      Grab a coffee if you like, and let me introduce myself.
    </p>

    <p class="about-text">
      I'm based in Hanoi, Vietnam, about 100 km from my hometown in Hung Yen Province, the old Thai Binh Province.
      I studied Information Technology at the <a href="https://mta.edu.vn/">Military Technical Academy</a>,
      and these days I'm fueled by coffee and books, with a little volleyball on the side.
    </p>

    <div class="section-title">// tech i work with</div>
    <p class="about-text">
      Beyond writing code, I spend my time on the platforms behind it: data, infrastructure and observability.
      These are the technologies and practices I work with.
    </p>
    <div class="chip-row">{chips.map((c) => <span class="tchip">{c}</span>)}</div>

    <p class="about-text">
      On the observability side I work with monitoring, Prometheus, Grafana and the ELK Stack.
      On the data side it is Big Data, Apache Kafka, ClickHouse as a data warehouse, and databases.
      And on the infrastructure side, DevOps and Kubernetes (K8s).
    </p>

    <div class="section-title">// why this blog</div>
    <p class="about-text">
      This blog is my notebook. Along the road I keep picking up knowledge: a bit of technology, some cryptography,
      a lot of programming, and the many moving parts of IT systems. Writing it down helps me remember it,
      and sharing it means someone else might skip a few of the wrong turns I took.
    </p>
    <p class="about-text">Here is what you can expect:</p>
    <div class="cats roomy">
      {topics.map(([k, c]) => (
        <a class="cat" href={`/category/${k}/`}><span class="ic">{c.icon}</span><strong>{c.name}</strong><small class="d">{c.desc}</small></a>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="about-text">
      And now and then, a few random things that don't fit anywhere else. Those are often the most fun to write.
    </p>

    <div class="section-title">// my journey</div>
    <ol class="timeline">
      <li class="tl">
        <span class="tl-tag">Roots</span>
        <h3>A rice-field childhood</h3>
        <p>I was born and raised in <strong>Hung Yen Province</strong>, in the area that used to be the old
        <strong>Thai Binh Province</strong>, about 100 km south-east of Hanoi. It is an agricultural land.
        Our local specialty is poverty, plus endless rice fields so wide that the storks can fly and fly
        without ever finding a place to land.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="tl">
        <span class="tl-tag">High school</span>
        <h3>The coolest school in town</h3>
        <p>I studied at <strong>Hung Nhan High School</strong>, probably the coolest school in my hometown and the one
        everybody dreams of getting into. It had excellent teachers, and it was just as famous for its
        good-looking students.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="tl">
        <span class="tl-tag">A big decision</span>
        <h3>Uniform and code</h3>
        <p>In my final year I made a hard decision: I chose the military, and I chose to study
        <strong>Information Technology</strong> at the
        <a href="https://mta.edu.vn/"><strong>Military Technical Academy</strong></a> (MTA).
        It wasn't easy, but I'm still happy and proud that I made that choice.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="tl">
        <span class="tl-tag">Today</span>
        <h3>Still learning, now in public</h3>
        <p>These days I'm a developer living in Hanoi, still curious, still learning, and writing down
        what I learn here so that I can keep it and share it.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="section-title">// beyond the keyboard</div>
    <div class="hobbies">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="ic">📚</span>
        <h3>Books</h3>
        <p>I love to read. Books are where a lot of my curiosity starts, and they are one of my favorite ways to learn.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="ic">☕</span>
        <h3>Coffee</h3>
        <p>I can't say exactly when it started, probably while I was preparing for the high school entrance exams,
        when coffee became my sidekick for staying focused and beating sleepiness. Today I drink it every day:
        morning, afternoon, and sometimes late at night.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="ic">🏐</span>
        <h3>Volleyball</h3>
        <p>I'm no national star, but at my workplace I'm ranked in the top ten. At 1.74 m tall,
        I'm the terror of every blocker.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">// say hello</div>
    <p class="about-text">
      If you want to talk about technology, or you have feedback on a post, you're always welcome to reach out.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:bachns@outlook.com">✉ Email</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="https://t.me/bachns">Telegram</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
